#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Both of these new features are currently in beta and require `qiskit-ibm-runtime` version 0.47.0 or higher.\n"
msgstr "  Beide neuen Features befinden sich derzeit in der Betaphase und erfordern `qiskit-ibm-runtime` Version 0.47.0 oder höher.\n"

